      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-07-11_WidnesExaminer_art0039" n="art0039">
        <head>GIRLS OF ST. MARY'S, BUTTERMARKET-STREET, Passing down Bold-street.</head>
        <p>THE GIRLS OF ST. MARY'S, BUTTERMARKET-STREET, Passing down Bold-street.</p>
        <p>there was not a single hitch in the pro- ceedings. The headmaster, Mr. David Morris, was in command, and the clergy were the Rev. Father T. 0. Swarbrick and the Rev. T. C. Jackson.</p>
